###
GET {{url_3000}} HTTP/1.1

### Health Check
GET {{url_3000}}/healthz HTTP/1.1


### Get All Products
GET {{url_5000}}/products HTTP/1.1

### Get Product by ID
GET {{url_5000}}/products/1 HTTP/1.1

### Create Product
POST {{url_5000}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "High-performance laptop with 16GB RAM",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 25
}

### Create Another Product
POST {{url_5000}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse with USB receiver",
  "price": 29.99,
  "stock": 100
}

### Update Product
PUT {{url_5000}}/products/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "High-performance laptop with 32GB RAM and SSD",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "stock": 15
}

### Delete Product
DELETE {{url_5000}}/products/2 HTTP/1.1